                        "tags": [
                            "reflexive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b296eec-d78f-4938-a29e-9ae9a8e7bb30",
                                "sense_id": "40ffac17-1a09-3040-87dd-e44e8723cc41",
                                "text": "\"Hij vond dat ik me veel meer op mijn eigen spel moest concentreren. Ik heb me meer op het scoren gericht, want dat kan ik gewoon”, aldus Van de Beek, die al zijn zesde seizoenstreffer aantekende. \"Wesley vindt dat ik heel goed kan voetballen, maar stipte aan dat ik me te veel wegcijferde. Uiteindelijk wordt een speler van Ajax op zijn goals en assists beoordeeld.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a66335f-9251-4a58-8eb5-ad7df7478f37",
                                "sense_id": "40ffac17-1a09-3040-87dd-e44e8723cc41",
                                "text": "Aardig is dat deze boekverfilming verschillende perspectieven toont. Van Auggie zelf natuurlijk, maar bijvoorbeeld ook van zijn moeder, die na zijn geboorte haar leven voor hem parkeerde. Indringender nog is het gezichtspunt van zijn oudere zus Via (Izabela Vidovic), die zichzelf al even hard wegcijferde om zo haar ouders niet nóg meer kopzorgen te geven. Minder geloofwaardig - en eigenlijk nogal onnodig - is de bijdrage van haar beste vriendin Miranda."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1355417f-0f34-429e-8bcc-a0d27c525819",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6d1852e-1f18-3feb-b1aa-9bc483d26494",
                        "source_sense_id": "9480c0d4-247a-3a80-8ab0-93a2257c9b58",
                        "target_lang_word": "ignore",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ignore",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6fbe3418-d861-3df6-a624-a83f766cb3c8",
                                        "entry_id": "66627c69-4a06-3882-b49d-4c3bd0458656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To deliberately not listen or pay attention to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "583584ee-adf0-4def-899a-951aa0514e33",
                                                "sense_id": "6fbe3418-d861-3df6-a624-a83f766cb3c8",
                                                "text": "A problem ignored is a problem doubled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5fd3a010-5720-4108-afdd-c52d861ca7fb",
                                                "sense_id": "6fbe3418-d861-3df6-a624-a83f766cb3c8",
                                                "text": "Ignore these four words."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbbf5923-ff49-4361-9687-710f26292738",
                                                "sense_id": "6fbe3418-d861-3df6-a624-a83f766cb3c8",
                                                "text": "One particularly damaging, but often ignored, effect of conflict on education is the proliferation of attacks on schools[…]as children, teachers or school buildings become the targets of attacks. Parents fear sending their children to school. Girls are particularly vulnerable to sexual violence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "747a3cfc-a72e-4069-bbe7-c029a178c127",
                                                "sense_id": "6fbe3418-d861-3df6-a624-a83f766cb3c8",
                                                "text": "The late Professor Pat White was an outspoken critic. In his 1986 book Forgotten Railways, he dismissed as smoke and mirrors the oft-used argument that 33% of rail routes carried only 1% of the traffic, as it ignores the fact that a third of the national road network also only carried 2% of cars and lorries. But unlike rail, road got away with it because no mention was made of how much it cost the taxpayer to keep them usable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a79378d8-eb77-3552-9dee-7f677d130e3d",
                                        "entry_id": "66627c69-4a06-3882-b49d-4c3bd0458656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To pretend to not notice someone or something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1cbd7b8-95a6-30af-ba8d-c7d50ad770a5",
                                        "entry_id": "66627c69-4a06-3882-b49d-4c3bd0458656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fail to notice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
